    "text": "there is one safety rule you shouldn't ignore.",
    "emphasis_words": [],
    "priority": "NORMAL"
  },
  {
    "caption_id": "C003",
    "start_sec": 6.14,
    "end_sec": 9.12,
    "text": "So start the counter, up to 30 seconds.",
    "emphasis_words": [],
    "priority": "NORMAL"
  },
  {
    "caption_id": "C004",
    "start_sec": 9.54,
    "end_sec": 11.22,
    "text": "Try to count the number of times that you",
